---
const problems = [
	{
		title: 'Every session starts blind',
		body: 'The agent in the mobile app doesn’t know which backend branch serves it, what was decided last week, or what another agent already started.',
	},
	{
		title: 'Context travels by copy and paste',
		body: 'You relay notes between chats, Claude Code and Codex by hand, and the details that mattered get lost on the way.',
	},
	{
		title: 'Plans leak into the wrong places',
		body: 'PLAN.md files land in product repos, and agent-made work items fill the team tracker you share with people.',
	},
];
---

<section class="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
	<div class="container stack">
		<header class="section-header">
			<p class="eyebrow">Why Silta</p>
			<h2 id="why-title" class="section-title">
				Coding agent work loses its thread.
			</h2>
			<p class="section-lead">
				Agents are fast inside one session. Between sessions, between repos and
				between tools, the picture falls apart, and you end up carrying it by
				hand.
			</p>
		</header>
		<ol class="card-grid">
			{problems.map((problem, index) => (
				<li class="card">
					<span class="number" aria-hidden="true">
						{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
					</span>
					<h3>{problem.title}</h3>
					<p class="card-body">{problem.body}</p>
				</li>
			))}
		</ol>
		<div class="band">
			<div class="band-copy">
				<p class="band-eyebrow">The bridge</p>
				<p class="band-title">Record it once. Read it where agents work.</p>
				<p class="band-body">
					Silta connects repos, sessions that never meet, and you with your
					agents. Plans and decisions live on the task, not in chats or repos.
				</p>
			</div>
			<svg
				class="arcs"
				width="420"
				height="210"
				viewBox="0 0 420 210"
				aria-hidden="true"
			>
				<path
					d="M10 210 A200 200 0 0 1 410 210"
					fill="none"
					stroke="rgb(255 255 255 / 12%)"
					stroke-width="28"
				></path>
				<path
					d="M80 210 A130 130 0 0 1 340 210"
					fill="none"
					stroke="rgb(255 255 255 / 8%)"
					stroke-width="20"
				></path>
			</svg>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.why {
		padding-block: var(--section-padding);
	}
	.stack {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 36px;
	}
	.number {
		color: var(--color-label-tertiary);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: var(--text-caption);
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 16px;
	}
	h3 {
		font-size: 20px;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 26px;
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
	}
	.band {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		padding: 30px 24px;
		border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
		background: var(--color-accent);
		color: var(--color-label-dark);
	}
	.band-copy {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 12px;
		max-width: 640px;
	}
	.band-eyebrow {
		color: rgb(255 255 255 / 70%);
		font-size: var(--text-caption);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 16px;
		letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.band-title {
		font-size: 24px;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 30px;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}
	.band-body {
		color: rgb(255 255 255 / 78%);
		font-size: var(--text-body);
		line-height: 26px;
	}
	.arcs {
		position: absolute;
		right: -150px;
		bottom: -120px;
		max-width: none;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.stack {
			gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
		}
		.band {
			padding: 44px 52px;
		}
		.band-title {
			font-size: 30px;
			line-height: 36px;
		}
		.arcs {
			right: -40px;
			bottom: -70px;
		}
	}
</style>
